TEXT -6400 -2928 Left 2 ;IREFn_DUTY: Arduino PWM duty on IREFn (J9) in 256ths, 490 Hz: 256 = always on, 128 = 50 %, 0 = off.\nPOTn_CODE: MCP4451 wiper code of U26A/B/C, 0-256 (0 = wiper at B = full current, 256 = at A = 0 A;
